 "A_certificate_A_X_text": "A_X[b] = sum over the eight rows of |coeff| * TAU = 8 * (1/(2 sqrt 2)) * mean(TAU) = (1/sqrt(2)) * sum_{g,a} TAU[b,g,a]   (each descendant TAU appears twice, once per carrier)",
 "A_certificate_A_PAIR_text": "A_PAIR[b,aN,aF] = 4 rows * (1/sqrt(2)) * TAU = sqrt(2) * (TAU[b,NEAR,aN] + TAU[b,FAR,aF])",
